      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Requirements like this and a lack of control over my own system are why I use an alternative to my Windows installation more and more.\n\nIf VRC requires this on Linux, I will also use an alternative to VRC.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
    {
      "_id": "6ad00e198deb8b42ab3efbaf",
      "aiGenerated": false,
